    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/c9371ffb61b16df356920e3611d53b6f.avif?t=1746066658\" width=300 height=96 /></span><br>Return(\u6eaf) is a pixel-style role-playing game with a rich storyline, special partner mechanics, and multiple branching paths. As the designer of the &quot;Kun&quot; aircraft, you will decide the planet's fate through your own hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters from Myth</h2>Unlike games that use Western myths as allusions, in &quot;Return(\u6eaf)&quot;, the monsters players face are based on the ancient Chinese book &quot;The Classic of Mountains and Seas&quot;. While exploring this fictional planet in the game, players can also feel the rich imagination of ancient people<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends?...Or Enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/1025baadce399d265d02c928595fb3c8.avif?t=1746066658\" width=500 height=186 /></span><br>Players will encounter multiple characters with different personalities and choose to cooperate or confront them. Each choice may affect the direction of the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention</h2>Our project is still in preparation, the current display content does not represent the final quality.<br>The English version will be provided when the game is officially released.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/a080a88f1ef2d7ac06f2ebb341eb2d08.avif?t=1746066658\" width=500 height=186 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/c9371ffb61b16df356920e3611d53b6f.avif?t=1746066658\" width=300 height=96 /></span><br>Return(\u6eaf) is a pixel-style role-playing game with a rich storyline, special partner mechanics, and multiple branching paths. As the designer of the &quot;Kun&quot; aircraft, you will decide the planet's fate through your own hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters from Myth</h2>Unlike games that use Western myths as allusions, in &quot;Return(\u6eaf)&quot;, the monsters players face are based on the ancient Chinese book &quot;The Classic of Mountains and Seas&quot;. While exploring this fictional planet in the game, players can also feel the rich imagination of ancient people<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends?...Or Enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/1025baadce399d265d02c928595fb3c8.avif?t=1746066658\" width=500 height=186 /></span><br>Players will encounter multiple characters with different personalities and choose to cooperate or confront them. Each choice may affect the direction of the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention</h2>Our project is still in preparation, the current display content does not represent the final quality.<br>The English version will be provided when the game is officially released.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944220/extras/a080a88f1ef2d7ac06f2ebb341eb2d08.avif?t=1746066658\" width=500 height=186 /></span>",
